     * @param x The uint128
     * @param first Whether to encode as the first or second uint128
     * @return z The encoded bytes32 as follows:
     * if first:
     * [0 - 128[: x
     * [128 - 256[: empty
     * else:
     * [0 - 128[: empty
     * [128 - 256[: x
     */
